# Intentionally empty (placeholder).
#
# No screenshots are stored in this folder — by policy and by Mobbin MCP capability.
# Mobbin MCP returns inline preview images for on-screen viewing only; it has no
# file/screenshot export resource. Saving those proprietary previews would violate the
# CosFan guardrails ("never save/commit screenshots", "do not copy competitor UI/assets").
#
# The curated pack is a UX/IA PATTERN pack, not a pixel pack. Study each reference by
# opening its Mobbin URL in ../VISUAL_REFERENCE_MANIFEST.md (source_pointer column).
#
# If a licensed pixel pack is ever required, follow "How to manually capture" in
# ../VISUAL_REFERENCE_MANIFEST.md and keep any captures LOCAL-ONLY (git-ignored).
